    Residual bias half-range & \SI{8.73e-4}{\radian\per\second} & \SI{0.05}{\degree\per\second} \\
    Bias random-walk & \SI{1e-5}{\radian\per\second\per\second\tothe{0.5}} & increment std $\propto \sqrt{\Delta t}$ \\
